    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Main Plane&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play as an amnesiac young girl, witnessing the construction of a colossal tower in a bizarre world. Unravel your own origins while uncovering the past and future of both the tower and this strange realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>Skill Seed-based skill assembly system</strong>. By combining dozens of in-game Skill Seeds, you can craft new abilities and customize unique combos tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/extras/86a087b5e29854d8dfaa780086d9e585.avif?t=1745571853\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore numerous <strong>compacted sandbox-style scenes</strong>, traverse diverse environments, encounter peculiar creatures, and discover new Skill Seeds to help you face increasingly formidable enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/extras/eb6f62cdf01e6317ede312d67fda36f3.avif?t=1745571853\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill-editing system for creating custom combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisitely cute, model-style character designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied and meticulously crafted sandbox scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies and challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive single-player narrative with dramatic twists.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Main Plane&quot;</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play as an amnesiac young girl, witnessing the construction of a colossal tower in a bizarre world. Unravel your own origins while uncovering the past and future of both the tower and this strange realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>Skill Seed-based skill assembly system</strong>. By combining dozens of in-game Skill Seeds, you can craft new abilities and customize unique combos tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/extras/86a087b5e29854d8dfaa780086d9e585.avif?t=1745571853\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore numerous <strong>compacted sandbox-style scenes</strong>, traverse diverse environments, encounter peculiar creatures, and discover new Skill Seeds to help you face increasingly formidable enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628910/extras/eb6f62cdf01e6317ede312d67fda36f3.avif?t=1745571853\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill-editing system for creating custom combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisitely cute, model-style character designs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied and meticulously crafted sandbox scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse enemies and challenging bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive single-player narrative with dramatic twists.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "This is an action game where you can freely edit skills. You can perform refreshing combos through the skills you carefully designed. At the same time, you will follow the protagonist to build your own memory, sort out your own understanding of this wonderful world, and finally back to Main Plane.",
